@{
   ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p>
   ExpenseWise runs on the Docker host where you install it. Your name, email address, phone number, password hash,
   groups, expenses, and recorded repayments are stored only in that installation's MySQL database.
</p>
<p>
   ExpenseWise does not process payments, send notifications, or share data with third parties. Group members can see
   the group's members, expenses, balances, and repayment history. The person who operates the installation controls
   its database and backups.
</p>